<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: royal mark -->
  <OE_RoyalTarget_Mark.label>皇家标记</OE_RoyalTarget_Mark.label>
  <!-- EN: A sinister emblem branded upon the target, signaling their doom at the hands of Obsidia Empire noble. It drains the target's mental resilience, making them vulnerable to attacks and slowing their movements, as they falter under the weight of inevitable capture. -->
  <OE_RoyalTarget_Mark.description>烙印在目标身上的邪恶徽记，预示着他们将被黑曜石帝国贵族所毁灭的命运。它会削弱目标的精神韧性，使他们容易受到攻击，行动迟缓，并在不可避免的被捕命运重压下摇摆不定。</OE_RoyalTarget_Mark.description>
  
</LanguageData>